5.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#1d222b;\">\n        Dear {{ $json.body.fullName.split(' ')[0] }},\n      </p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Jost', 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#1d222b;\">\n        We are pleased to inform you that the partnership application for\n        <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#1d222b;\">{{ $json.body.restaurantName }}</strong>\n        has been <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#1d222b;\">approved</strong>.\n      </p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Jost', 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#1d222b;\">\n        You can now access the Partner Dashboard to manage reservations, guests, and your restaurant information.\n      </p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-family:'Jost', 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#1d222b;\">\n        Sign in using the email address\n        <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#1d222b;\">{{ $json.body.email }}</strong>.\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- CTA -->\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0 auto 28px;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#070b10\" style=\"background-color:#070b10;border-radius:4px;\">\n            <!--[if mso]>\n            <v:roundrect xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" href=\"https://manager.theworldkeys.com/log-in\" style=\"height:48px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:240px;\" arcsize=\"8%\" stroke=\"f\" fillcolor=\"#070b10\">\n              <w:anchorlock/>\n              <center style=\"color:#c9a96e;font-family:Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;\">ACCESS DASHBOARD</center>\n            </v:roundrect>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <a href=\"https://manager.theworldkeys.com/log-in\" target=\"_blank\"\n               style=\"display:inline-block;padding:16px 36px;font-family:'Jost', 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#c9a96e;text-decoration:none;background-color:#070b10;border-radius:4px;\">\n              ACCESS DASHBOARD\n            </a>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Jost', 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#1d222b;\">\n        If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste the following link into your browser:<br/>\n        <a href=\"https://manager.theworldkeys.com/log-in\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#9e7c48;word-break:break-all;\">https://manager.theworldkeys.com/log-in</a>\n      </p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Jost', 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#1d222b;\">\n        Kind regards,<br/>\n        The World Keys<br/>\n        support@theworldkeys.com\n      </p>\n    </td></tr>\n\n  \n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 30px 6px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 13px;\">\n            <a href=\"https://wa.me/5521967841007\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n              <img src=\"https://theworldkeys-aria-whatsapp-agent.xis4ee.easypanel.host/icons/whatsapp.png\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" style=\"display:block;border:0;opacity:0.75;\" />\n            </a>\n          </td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 13px;\">\n            <a href=\"mailto:support@theworldkeys.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n              <img src=\"https://theworldkeys-aria-whatsapp-